---
title: "initializePublishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: authorized
    q_check_ended --> q_check_locked: endTime < now (sale ended)
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_timing: sale not ended
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_locked --> q_lock: cancelLocked == false
    q_check_locked --> q_revert_locked: already locked
    q_revert_locked --> [*]: revert AlreadyLocked
    q_lock --> [*]: cancelLocked = true, emit PublishInitialized

    note right of q_lock
        INV-001: once cancelLocked = true, cancel() is permanently blocked
        INV-002: creates a two-phase commit for result publication
        INV-003: must be called after sale end, before publishSaleResults
    end note
